/// For more information about partially successful responses, see Adding
/// Multiple Records with PutRecords in the Amazon Kinesis Data Streams
/// Developer Guide . After you write a record to a stream, you cannot
/// modify that record or its order within the stream. By default, data
/// records are accessible for 24 hours from the time that they are added to
